msgid "One-glance view of every SSID, its bound L2TP egress, current public IP and connection state. Apply config regenerates network/wireless/pbr from /etc/config/l2tppool."
msgstr "一屏查看每个SSID、绑定的L2TP出口、当前公网IP与连接状态。「重新应用配置」会根据 /etc/config/l2tppool 重新生成 network/wireless/pbr。"

msgid "Add/remove L2TP dial accounts. Each becomes an independent interface (proto l2tp, defaultroute=0). Save here, then click Apply config on the Overview page to generate the interfaces."
msgstr "增删L2TP拨号账号。每个账号会生成独立接口(proto l2tp, defaultroute=0)。保存后到总览页点「重新应用配置」生成接口。"

msgid "Each binding creates an independent LAN segment + SSID, and binds it to a chosen L2TP account via a PBR policy. Save here, then click Apply config on the Overview page."
msgstr "每个绑定会创建独立LAN网段+SSID，并通过PBR策略绑定到指定L2TP账号。保存后到总览页点「重新应用配置」。"

msgid "Switch a SSID from its current L2TP account to the next enabled account in the pool. PBR is updated and the new egress IP is probed automatically."
msgstr "把某SSID从当前L2TP账号切换到池中下一个可用账号，自动更新PBR并探测新出口IP。"

msgid "Inspect generated network/wireless/pbr config, routes, interface states and recent logs. Use ipcheck to probe a single interface public IP."
msgstr "查看生成的 network/wireless/pbr 配置、路由、接口状态与最近日志。可用 ipcheck 探测单个接口公网IP。"
